    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an RPG where NPCs, items, locations, stories, and every aspect of the world are generated in real time by both AI and the player. You may seek wealth and fame through grand adventures, or simply live out your days working quietly in town \u2014 how you live is entirely up to your own words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/ec66321072705e15390fa2181914bb3d.poster.avif?t=1755165737\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/ec66321072705e15390fa2181914bb3d.webm?t=1755165737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/ec66321072705e15390fa2181914bb3d.mp4?t=1755165737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Natural Language Actions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses through a back-and-forth exchange of natural language between the player and the AI. You can act freely \u2014 making use of skills, items, and the surrounding environment on the spur of the moment to gain an advantage in combat or exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/e34b9e7d6fcc77f8e51c905dae55c8de.poster.avif?t=1755165737\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/e34b9e7d6fcc77f8e51c905dae55c8de.webm?t=1755165737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/e34b9e7d6fcc77f8e51c905dae55c8de.mp4?t=1755165737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Highly Flexible Character Creation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appearance, background, skills, Items and more are described in natural language, allowing you to create an original character with high degree of freedom and variation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/7284ec7bdb810b699b6bbaa9a067a4b2.poster.avif?t=1755165737\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/7284ec7bdb810b699b6bbaa9a067a4b2.webm?t=1755165737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/7284ec7bdb810b699b6bbaa9a067a4b2.mp4?t=1755165737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free Conversation and Relationship Building with NPCs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no fixed lines of dialogue. You can freely talk with NPCs of all kinds, each with their own personality, and build relationships through genuine interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/cd728a080e69a16c609a66ceb7e3ec18.poster.avif?t=1755165737\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/cd728a080e69a16c609a66ceb7e3ec18.webm?t=1755165737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/cd728a080e69a16c609a66ceb7e3ec18.mp4?t=1755165737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Permanent Death and Inheritance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a character\u2019s HP reaches zero, they die and cannot be revived. Upon the death of a player character, some of the wealth and assets they accumulated in life can be carried over to future playthroughs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lifespan and Resource Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you never fall in battle, your character will eventually grow old and reach the end of their life. Age, injuries, fatigue, and living expenses all influence your limited time, making the way you spend it a crucial part of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb\u30fb\u30fb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although it features a UI reminiscent of traditional RPGs, the game contains many elements of a life simulation. In the beginning, you are born as an extremely weak individual and face a harsh life. Some days may be spent earning meager wages through tedious labor rather than adventuring. If you manage to achieve success in your adventures, you can recruit allies to take on even greater challenges, or spend your hard-earned wealth to live a peaceful life until your final days.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an RPG where NPCs, items, locations, stories, and every aspect of the world are generated in real time by both AI and the player. You may seek wealth and fame through grand adventures, or simply live out your days working quietly in town \u2014 how you live is entirely up to your own words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/ec66321072705e15390fa2181914bb3d.poster.avif?t=1755165737\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/ec66321072705e15390fa2181914bb3d.webm?t=1755165737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/ec66321072705e15390fa2181914bb3d.mp4?t=1755165737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Natural Language Actions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses through a back-and-forth exchange of natural language between the player and the AI. You can act freely \u2014 making use of skills, items, and the surrounding environment on the spur of the moment to gain an advantage in combat or exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/e34b9e7d6fcc77f8e51c905dae55c8de.poster.avif?t=1755165737\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/e34b9e7d6fcc77f8e51c905dae55c8de.webm?t=1755165737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/e34b9e7d6fcc77f8e51c905dae55c8de.mp4?t=1755165737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Highly Flexible Character Creation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appearance, background, skills, Items and more are described in natural language, allowing you to create an original character with high degree of freedom and variation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/7284ec7bdb810b699b6bbaa9a067a4b2.poster.avif?t=1755165737\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/7284ec7bdb810b699b6bbaa9a067a4b2.webm?t=1755165737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/7284ec7bdb810b699b6bbaa9a067a4b2.mp4?t=1755165737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free Conversation and Relationship Building with NPCs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no fixed lines of dialogue. You can freely talk with NPCs of all kinds, each with their own personality, and build relationships through genuine interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/cd728a080e69a16c609a66ceb7e3ec18.poster.avif?t=1755165737\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/cd728a080e69a16c609a66ceb7e3ec18.webm?t=1755165737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633480/extras/cd728a080e69a16c609a66ceb7e3ec18.mp4?t=1755165737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Permanent Death and Inheritance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a character\u2019s HP reaches zero, they die and cannot be revived. Upon the death of a player character, some of the wealth and assets they accumulated in life can be carried over to future playthroughs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lifespan and Resource Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you never fall in battle, your character will eventually grow old and reach the end of their life. Age, injuries, fatigue, and living expenses all influence your limited time, making the way you spend it a crucial part of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb\u30fb\u30fb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although it features a UI reminiscent of traditional RPGs, the game contains many elements of a life simulation. In the beginning, you are born as an extremely weak individual and face a harsh life. Some days may be spent earning meager wages through tedious labor rather than adventuring. If you manage to achieve success in your adventures, you can recruit allies to take on even greater challenges, or spend your hard-earned wealth to live a peaceful life until your final days.</p>",
    "short_description": "This is an RPG where the world, dungeons, NPCs, items, and even the story are all generated on the fly by AI. Players can freely converse with truly unique NPCs, explore the world in search of endlessly diverse items, or simply choose to live an ordinary life without doing anything at all.",
