        "notes": "This game does not contain sexual acts or depictions in either text or visuals. While marriage and romantic relationships with NPCs are possible, no explicit sexual content is shown or implied.\r\n\r\nThere is no non-consensual sexual content or BDSM themes. Some characters may use magic to charm or dominate others, resulting in temporary control or servitude, but this is presented as part of a fantasy combat system and not depicted in a sexualized or fetishized manner.\r\n\r\nCombat includes the possibility of characters being confused, controlled, or forced to perform self-damaging actions. These are presented as gameplay mechanics and not as depictions of self-harm. \r\n\r\nAlcoholic beverages and drug-like healing items exist as in-game items, but are not the focus of the gameplay or narrative.\r\n"
